<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - St Jude buy restated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - St Jude buy restated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it maintained its buy rating on St. Jude Medical Inc.</p>
<p>-- Said proposed acquisition of Ventritex Inc will not be affected by reports that Ventritex's V110 ICD device has caused patient problems.</p>
<p>-- Does not expect terms of the deal to change.</p>
<p>-- Estimates that about 5,600 patients may need to be examined or treated due to the problems, but costs of this &quot;development&quot; are not likely to be significant.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
